{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2689","published":"2026-06-24T11:11:37Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:20:05.972168951Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-10294"],"summary":"PackageKit security update","details":"PackageKit is a D-Bus abstraction layer that allows the session user to manage packages in a secure way using a cross-distro, cross-architecture API.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA vulnerability has been found in PackageKit up to 1.3.5. Affected is the function g_file_test of the file src/pk-transaction.c of the component API. Such manipulation of the argument frontend-socket leads to improper authorization. The attack can be executed remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used.(CVE-2026-10294)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"PackageKit","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/PackageKit&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["PackageKit-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","PackageKit-command-not-found-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","PackageKit-debuginfo-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","PackageKit-debugsource-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","PackageKit-devel-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","PackageKit-gtk3-module-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["PackageKit-help-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["PackageKit-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["PackageKit-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","PackageKit-command-not-found-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","PackageKit-debuginfo-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","PackageKit-debugsource-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","PackageKit-devel-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","PackageKit-gtk3-module-1.2.8-6.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2689.json"}},{"package":{"name":"PackageKit","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/PackageKit&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"range